  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The vampires' first strike has laid low the world, and their endless legions run riot across the planet. The broken Avengers join the fighters of the Midnight Mission and unlikely allies BLOODLINE and DRACULA in seeking out the one man who can do something about this: Doctor Strange."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "But after the apocalyptic events of BLOOD HUNT #1, what is left of Earth's Sorcerer Supreme?"
    }
